              "new": "    :param stopwords (iterable): words to discount; one-shot iterables are consumed once\n    :param regex_pattern (str): regex pattern for disallowed characters\n    :param lowercase (bool): activate case sensitivity by setting it to False\n    :param replacements (iterable): list of replacement rules e.g. [['|', 'or'], ['%', 'percent']];\n        one-shot iterables, including one-shot rule iterables, are consumed once and applied in\n        both the initial and final replacement passes with original rule order preserved\n    :param allow_unicode (bool): allow unicode characters\n    :return (str):\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # materialize one-shot iterables so they can be used in both replacement passes\n    if replacements is not None:\n        replacements = [tuple(rule) for rule in replacements]\n    if stopwords is not None:\n        stopwords = list(stopwords)\n\n    # user-specific replacements\n    if replacements:\n        for old, new in replacements:\n            text = text.replace(old, new)",
